cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LCA Studio: a teaching platform for environmental life cycle assessment, social life cycle assessment and life cycle costing"
abstract: >-
  A single-file browser tool for teaching life cycle sustainability assessment.
  Learners build one product system and examine it from three sides: environmental
  LCA after ISO 14040 and ISO 14044, social LCA after the UNEP (2020) guidelines
  and ISO 14075 with PSILCA v4.0 reference scales, and life cycle costing with
  explicit cost timing and discounting. Developed for Module 3 of the H2VE German
  Centre of Vocational Excellence curriculum.
message: "If you use this tool in teaching or research, please cite it."
type: software
